er will be responsible for the payment methods and related features such as subscriptions and refunds. App Store features, such as your stored App Store payment method, subscription management and refund requests, will not be available.","WEA.AppPages.ExternalPurchaseInformation.Text.noDeveloper.NL":"All purchases in this app will be processed by a service provider selected by the developer. The developer will be responsible for the payment methods and related features such as subscriptions and refunds. App Store features, such as your stored App Store payment method, subscription management and refund requests, will not be available.","WEA.AppPages.ExternalPurchaseInformation.Title":"Externe Käufe","WEA.AppPages.FB.siteName.desktopApp":"Mac App Store","WEA.AppPages.FB.siteName.iosSoftware":"App Store","WEA.AppPages.FB.siteName.mobileSoftwareBundle":"App Store","WEA.AppPages.FamilySharing":"Familienfreigabe","WEA.AppPages.FeaturedIn.Title":"Lies mehr","WEA.AppPages.GameController":"Gamecontroller","WEA.AppPages.InAppPurchase.Title":"In-App-Käufe","WEA.AppPages.InAppPurchases.Title":"In‑App‑Käufe","WEA.AppPages.Information.Title":"Informationen","WEA.AppPages.Languages":"Sprachen","WEA.AppPages.LicenseAgreement":"Lizenzvertrag","WEA.AppPages.Location.Description":"Diese App verwendet möglicherweise deinen Standort, selbst wenn sie nicht geöffnet ist. Dadurch kann sich die Batterielaufzeit verkürzen.","WEA.AppPages.Location.Title":"Standort","WEA.AppPages.MacAppStore.Header":"Mac App Store","WEA.AppPages.Meta.MacAppPageMetaDescriptionLine":"Lies Rezensionen, vergleiche Kundenbewertungen, sieh dir Screenshots an und erfahre mehr über @@softwareName@@. Lade @@softwareName@@ für macOS @@minimumOSVersion@@ oder neuer und genieße die App auf deinem Mac.","WEA.AppPages.Meta.MacAppPageMetaKeywords":"@@softwareName@@, @@developerName@@, @@categoryNames@@, mac-apps, app store, appstore, apps, anwendungen, itunes","WEA.AppPages.Meta.MacAppStorePageTitle":"@@softwareName@@ im Ma