IRILERI O YÖNETIMDEKI KISILERI DURDURMASI GEREK YOKSA YALLA KAPANSIN\",\"rating\":1,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Intriegen DIKKAT\",\"userName\":\"0002111\"}},{\"id\":\"5270731330\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-12-14T08:24:11Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":12397474,\"body\":\"Hello dear! We are happy to be with you in Yalla. Yalla is an original application that allows you to meet new friends from around the Arab world. We hope that your next comment will also be five stars. If you have suggestions, you can contact yallasupport@yalla.live.\\r\\n\",\"modified\":\"2019-12-15T04:04:42Z\"},\"review\":\"🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰🥰\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"🥰🥰🥰\",\"userName\":\"🥰🇱🇧❤️🥰🇱🇧❤️\"}},{\"id\":\"9201913271\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2022-10-20T00:00:32Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":32811013,\"body\":\"أصدقائي الأعزاء ، شكرًا لتقيمكم الخمس نجوم لـتطبيق يلا، تقديركم هو أعظم شرف لنا. سنواصل العمل الجاد للحصول على تقييمك التالي ذي الخمس نجوم.  إذا كان لديك أي ملاحظات أو اقتراحات ، يمكنك الاتصال بنا من خلال الإنطباعات داخل التطبيق ، فريق خدمة العملاء يلا في خدمتك على مدار 24 ساعة في اليوم ~ أتمنى لك حياة سعيدة ~\",\"modified\":\"2022-10-27T06:09:39Z\"},\"review\":\"Good thinking\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Nice\",\"userName\":\"pk jimi\"}},{\"id\":\"6745569491\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2020-12-12T16:10:44Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":19732345,\"body\":\"Hi, most users (more than 99%) enjoy Yalla for free and they love to have fun with many friends together. And we support many languages, try to change another language in Yalla . You can click on the avatar and select the language option. If you have any suggestions, you can contact yallasupport@yalla.live and we hope to see your distinguished comment with the five stars. Thank you!\",\"modified\":\"2020-12-14T03:10:36Z\"},\"review\":\"How do i change the language,\\nAll of a sudden i got Turkish??\",\"rating\":1,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Problem solving..\",\"userName\":\"Ava1010\"}},{\"id\":\"1777283249\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2017-09-06T16:59:11Z\",\"review\":\"Very good\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Yalla\",\"userName\":\"Mohammed turky 1998\"}},{\"id\":\"1597763036\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2017-04-26T03:43:38Z\",\"review\":\"I like it\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Good\",\"userName\":\"Almuftres\"}},{\"id\":\"9674766284\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2023-03-03T14:47:44Z\",\"developerResponse\":{\"id\":35263687,\"body\":\"Dear friend, it is our greatest honor to see your five-star praise. We will always provide you with the best service and product experience. If you have any questions in the future, please contact us in Feedback as soon as possible. We are keen to solve all in-app problems for users. Finally, wish you a good time in Yalla.\",\"modified\":\"2023-03-08T01:57:50Z\"},\"review\":\"Allees ok\",\"rating\":5,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"👍👍\",\"userName\":\"nermin868686\"}},{\"id\":\"4364108219\",\"type\":\"user-reviews\",\"attributes\":{\"date\":\"2019-06-24T16:07:03Z\",\"review\":\"Kafasına göre işlem uygulanıyor\",\"rating\":1,\"isEdited\":false,\"title\":\"Keyfi ban\",\"userName\":\"keyfiislemuygulandı\"}}]},\"top-in-apps\":{\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/de/apps/1091902866/top-in-apps?l=de-DE\",\"data\":[{\"id\":\"1100991711\",\"type\":\"in-apps\",\"href\":\"/v1/catalog/de/in-apps/1100991711?l=de-DE\",\"attributes\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=A\u0026price=1190\u0026salableAdamId=1100991711\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\",\"type\":\"buy\",\"priceFormatted\":\"1,19 €\",\"price\":1.19,\"currencyCode\":\"EUR\",\"assets\":[]}],\"isSubscription\":false,\"isMerchandisedVisibleByDefault\":false,\"offerName\":\"com.weieyu.yalla.pro.oneDA\",\"isFamilyShareable\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2009-06-17\",\"isMerchandisedEna