gColor\":\"481c3a\",\"textColor1\":\"fff077\",\"textColor2\":\"fcb52e\",\"textColor3\":\"dac56a\",\"textColor4\":\"d89731\"}],\"iphone6+\":[{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2208,\"url\":\"https://is2-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple122/v4/0a/fb/55/0afb5523-d7e9-4efe-8e58-059f3a423106/8ccb4c8a-58b9-4397-8177-74cb057fe0e4__U6e38_U620f_U51853.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"451b32\",\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"f79500\",\"textColor3\":\"d9d1d6\",\"textColor4\":\"d37d0a\"},{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2208,\"url\":\"https://is5-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource122/v4/e5/55/5a/e5555a82-1248-7d67-59ee-fa38de24b93c/57c68ce8-c65d-4498-9dac-fb66b2ca133c_bingoXY.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"451b32\",\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"fefae4\",\"textColor3\":\"d9d1d6\",\"textColor4\":\"d9cdc1\"},{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2208,\"url\":\"https://is5-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple112/v4/7e/18/08/7e18088c-d08e-4850-2a43-77a1ce1ddd5c/f72f5caa-0b9b-444b-a326-5ab1182fc909__U8bed_U97f3.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"4b1f3c\",\"textColor1\":\"e8e6e8\",\"textColor2\":\"0cbaea\",\"textColor3\":\"c8bec5\",\"textColor4\":\"189bc7\"},{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2208,\"url\":\"https://is5-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple122/v4/45/85/f2/4585f263-cd9b-f5c4-849b-23dc14e91a50/bc5cbfe0-93ec-471a-9e2e-c39076f69f9b__U804a_U5929_U5ba4.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"4b1f3c\",\"textColor1\":\"feec75\",\"textColor2\":\"ece5f0\",\"textColor3\":\"dac36a\",\"textColor4\":\"ccbdcc\"},{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2208,\"url\":\"https://is3-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple112/v4/70/c8/33/70c833d2-fc86-1cd9-8ab4-e2b3445e946c/600d6a50-93aa-4238-bb5d-bc2452395b65__U597d_U53cb.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"491e4b\",\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"ffc430\",\"textColor3\":\"dad1da\",\"textColor4\":\"daa236\"},{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2208,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple112/v4/48/61/7d/48617d29-4c13-d836-2ce9-8df0e1fcd07f