nungen\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"}]},{\"privacyType\":\"Nicht mit dir verknüpfte Daten\",\"identifier\":\"DATA_NOT_LINKED_TO_YOU\",\"description\":\"Die folgenden Daten werden zwar möglicherweise erfasst, aber nicht mit deiner Identität verknüpft:\",\"dataCategories\":[{\"dataCategory\":\"Kontakt­informa­tionen\",\"identifier\":\"CONTACT_INFO\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Kontakte\",\"identifier\":\"CONTACTS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Benutzer­inhalte\",\"identifier\":\"USER_CONTENT\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Kennungen\",\"identifier\":\"IDENTIFIERS\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Nutzungs­daten\",\"identifier\":\"USAGE_DATA\"},{\"dataCategory\":\"Diagnose\",\"identifier\":\"DIAGNOSTICS\"}]}]},\"contentRatingsBySystem\":{\"appsApple\":{\"name\":\"12+\",\"value\":300,\"rank\":3,\"advisories\":[\"Selten/schwach ausgeprägt: Horror-/Gruselszenen\",\"Selten/schwach ausgeprägt: obszöner oder vulgärer Humor\",\"Selten/schwach ausgeprägt: medizinische/Behandlungs-Informationen\",\"Selten/schwach ausgeprägt: Szenen mit erotischen Anspielungen\"]}},\"deviceFamilies\":[\"iphone\",\"ipod\"],\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/de/app/partybus-group-audio-chat/id1562989000\",\"userRating\":{\"value\":3.7,\"ratingCount\":3,\"ratingCountList\":[1,0,0,0,2],\"ariaLabelForRatings\":\"3.7 Sterne\"},\"genreDisplayName\":\"Unterhaltung\",\"name\":\"Partybus - group audio chat\",\"isPreorder\":false,\"artistName\":\"Chatwith Inc\",\"isIOSBinaryMacOSCompatible\":true,\"reviewsRestricted\":false,\"requirementsByDeviceFamily\":{\"ipod\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPod touch\",\"requirementString\":\"Erfordert iOS 11.0 oder neuer.\"},\"iphone\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"iPhone\",\"requirementString\":\"Erfordert iOS 11.0 oder neuer.\"},\"mac\":{\"deviceFamily\":\"Mac\",\"requirementString\":\"Erfordert macOS 11.0 (oder neuer) und einen Mac mit Apple M1-Chip (oder neuer).\"}},\"platformAttributes\":{\"ios\":{\"offers\":[{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1562989000\u0026pricingParameters=STDQ\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=847564048\",\"type\":\"get\",\"priceFormatted\":\"0,00 €\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"EUR\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":61215744}]},{\"buyParams\":\"productType=C\u0026price=0\u0026salableAdamId=1562989000\u0026pricingParameters=SWUPD\u0026pg=default\u0026appExtVrsId=847564048\",\"type\":\"update\",\"priceFormatted\":\"0,00 €\",\"price\":0,\"currencyCode\":\"EUR\",\"assets\":[{\"flavor\":\"iosSoftware\",\"size\":61215744}]}],\"minimumMacOSVersion\":\"11.0\",\"requires32bit\":false,\"releaseDate\":\"2021-06-02\",\"hasInAppPurchases\":false,\"bundleId\":\"com.onpartybus.ios\",\"description\":{\"standard\":\"Partybus is a dedicated hangout spot for you to connect with other GenZ’ers over mutual interests, whether it be music, memes, or mental health. It is also ideal if you want to delve deeper into pressing issues, build community, and discuss how we can support each other to work towards a more equitable world.\\n\\nOn Partybus, you can:\\nTalk to fun GenZ’ers globally \\nHold engaging conversations in audio chats \\nConnect with like-minded people \\nBuild and grow your own community \\n\\nOur generation is like no other: we tout our creativity in TikTok videos, reddit memes, and other online spaces. At the same time, we face unprecedented challenges such as crippling student debt and the climate crisis. This is why we created Partybus to carve out a special space for you to chat about whatever concerns you the most.  \\n\\nStart today to connect and enjoy all the fun on Partybus!\"},\"hasMessagesExtension\":false,\"isStandaloneWithCompanionForWatchOS\":false,\"artwork\":{\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"url\":\"https://is3-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/db/60/0f/db600f4c-b754-14a9-e7f5-5e9f3dbc008f/AppIcon-0-0-1x_U007emarketing-0-0-0-6-0-0-sRGB-0-0-0-GLES2_U002c0-512MB-85-220-0-0.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"dcf48d\",\"textColor2\":\"f4d889\",\"textColor3\":\"b0c371\",\"textColor4\":\"c3ad6d\"},\"privacyPolicyUrl\":\"https://www.partybusapp.com/PrivacyPolicy.html\",\"videoPreviewsByType\":{},\"isAppleWatchSupported\":false,\"supportURLForLanguage\":\"https://www.partybusapp.com\",\"isHiddenFromSpringboard\":false,\"isStandaloneForWatchOS\":false,\"isDeliveredInIOSAppForWatchOS\":false,\"versionHistory\":[{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.2\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Important update! We have solved the problem of program crashes!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-03-07\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-03-07T14:51:46Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.1\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Important update! We have solved the problem of program crashes!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2022-01-04\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2022-01-04T18:00:08Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.5.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Important update! We have solved the problem of program crashes!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-09-28\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-09-28T00:48:58Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.4.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"Important update! We have solved the problem of program crashes!\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-08-26\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-08-26T19:12:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.3.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- We add global mode, you can see parties in your area default, but you can explore parties in other areas. \\n- Performance improvement\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-07-16\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-07-16T17:15:32Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.2.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- We add global mode, you can see parties in your area default, but you can explore parties in other areas. \\n- Performance improvement\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-06-22\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-06-22T16:19:49Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":\"- A party now can be held in auto mode, when in this mode, everyone can hands up and take turns to speak. \\n- Performance improvement.\",\"releaseDate\":\"2021-06-10\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-06-10T22:35:09Z\"},{\"versionDisplay\":\"1.0\",\"releaseNotes\":null,\"releaseDate\":\"2021-06-02\",\"releaseTimestamp\":\"2021-06-02T10:09:42Z\"}],\"editorialArtwork\":{\"brandLogo\":{\"width\":1080,\"height\":1080,\"url\":\"https://is5-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Features124/v4/e4/70/aa/e470aaba-7611-d3bb-ebf3-9b34e2f2d74e/pr_source.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"f2f2f2\",\"textColor2\":\"e5e5e5\",\"textColor3\":\"c1c1c1\",\"textColor4\":\"b7b7b7\"}},\"messagesScreenshots\":{},\"hasSafariExtension\":false,\"requiresGameController\":false,\"customAttributes\":{\"default\":{\"default\":{\"customScreenshotsByType\":{\"iphone6+\":[{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2208,\"url\":\"https://is4-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource115/v4/58/ea/c0/58eac099-b7b0-7974-04d3-1a14a54cce90/37ca3057-0512-41e9-b8b8-5d3991743c18_1.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"f7c187\",\"textColor3\":\"cbcbcb\",\"textColor4\":\"c59a6c\"},{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2208,\"url\":\"https://is3-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource125/v4/af/cd/d9/afcdd903-f495-4703-3a0d-93cd7d9d0e03/4953add2-d4bf-4326-8d95-4100c1cf7de1_2.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"fab587\",\"textColor3\":\"cbcbcb\",\"textColor4\":\"c8916c\"},{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2208,\"url\":\"https://is5-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource125/v4/1e/ad/56/1ead5674-6166-b64a-6e9b-a061e39f466d/88b95759-5f9b-4b56-92c1-90fc18dc7b2a_3.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"3bddee\",\"textColor3\":\"cbcbcb\",\"textColor4\":\"2fb1bf\"},{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2208,\"url\":\"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource125/v4/17/27/ae/1727ae15-9d36-a0e7-5f67-0ca0bf7adfb9/ea477388-7289-41ac-9dd9-dc9b44babc1a_4.png/{w}x{h}{c}.{f}\",\"bgColor\":\"000000\",\"textColor1\":\"ffffff\",\"textColor2\":\"cecece\",\"textColor3\":\"cbcbcb\",\"textColor4\":\"a5a5a5\"}],\"iphone_6_5\":[{\"width\":1242,\"height\":2688,\"url\":\"https://is2-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/